## Approach 4: Optimized Python One-Liner

### Python Code

```python
class Solution:
    def countEdges(self, adj: list[list[int]]) -> int:
        return sum(len(i) for i in adj) // 2
```

### Complexity Analysis

- Time Complexity: O(V)
- Auxiliary Space: O(1)

